<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>The Hague &amp; Scheveningen Guide: 11 places – Mauritshuis, Binnenhof, beach &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Mauritshuis</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book tickets with a time slot and come at opening. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>4.31431,52.08039,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Scheveningen beach &amp; pier</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go in the afternoon, stay for sunset and eat fish at the harbour. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>4.28343,52.1153,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Binnenhof &amp; Hofvijver</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Check tours beforehand and come to the Hofvijver in evening light. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>4.31237,52.07933,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Peace Palace</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Plan the visit at the visitor centre and book a tour if possible. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>4.29563,52.08639,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Escher in Het Paleis</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Perfect in rain and with children. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>4.31426,52.08342,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Kunstmuseum Den Haag – Mondrian</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Take the tram and plan two to three hours. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>4.28073,52.08972,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Madurodam – the Netherlands in miniature</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine Madurodam with a beach day in Scheveningen. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>4.29738,52.09954,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Panorama Mesdag</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Perfect in rain and easy to combine with the Mauritshuis. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>4.30328,52.08471,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Scheveningen harbour – fish fresh from the boat</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Eat herring or kibbeling at the harbour and drink a coffee overlooking the boats. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>4.26598,52.10019,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Haagse Markt – multicultural market</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning with cash and hungry. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>4.29932,52.0644,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Noordeinde Palace &amp; Haagse Hopjes</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Take Hopjes with you as a souvenir. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/the-hague/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>4.30648,52.08075,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
